    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSea View Lodge, Inch Road, Blackwater, Co. Wexford.\n\nExceptional Coastal Residence on C. 1.95 Acres with Sea Views.\n\nWake up to sea views, fresh coastal air and complete privacy in this exceptional detached residence set on approximately 1.95 acres of beautifully landscaped grounds, just 1km from Blackwater Village.\n\nSea View Lodge offers bright and spacious accommodation and is presented in turn key condition throughout. Elegant reception rooms and a sun filled sunroom provide ideal spaces for both relaxing and entertaining, while the recently upgraded kitchen/dining area (2023) features quality finishes and integrated appliances.\n\nThe property boasts four generously sized bedrooms, all ensuite, having five bathrooms in total and is perfect for modern family living or hosting guests in comfort.\n\nExtensively upgraded in recent years, features include triple glazed windows (with remaining warranty), full insulation, dual-zone Nest heating controls, a new woodburning stove, pressurised water system and energy efficient LED lighting throughout.\n\nOutside, the home continues to impress with a newly finished driveway, secure fenced gardens, and a stylish gazebo with outdoor seating, ideal for long summer evenings. Further benefits include a large detached garage with separate office/craft room, serviced septic system, new water pump, upgraded heating systems and a freshly painted exterior.\n\nIdeally located close to Wexford's renowned award winning beaches and within easy reach of Wexford Town, this is a rare opportunity to secure a high quality coastal home offering both tranquility and convenience.\n\nVirtual tour online.\n\nTo note there has been small AI enhancements made in this advert due to weather conditions."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.86m x 4.52m\nBright open Hallway with coving, recessed lighting, doors to Kitchen, Living area & Inner Hallway.\n\nLiving Room - 7.6m x 4.41m\nSEA VIEWS. Solid Oak Floors, coving, recessed lighting, Solid fuel stove with brick insert surround, black slate and sandstone mantlepiece.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 6.29m x 5.02m\nNew kitchen fitted in 2023 by Kitchen World of Waterford, Siemens Induction Hob, integrated fridge, separate freezer and dishwasher. New woodburning stove in the kitchen provided by Wexford stoves and fireplaces. Double doors to Sun Room. Door to Utility.\n\nSunroom - 4.65m x 4.35m\nSouth facing Sunroom with Sea views.\n\nUtility Room - 3.57m x 2.5m\nFitted work top, plumbed for washing machine, fitted units, door to garden with cat flap. Tiled splashback, sink unit, solid wood timber floors.\n\nGuest wc - 1.80m x 1.6m\nWith w.c, w.h.b.\n\nHotpress storage - 1.93m x 1.78m\n\n\nInner Hall - 7.76m x 4.46m\n\n\nOffice - 2.99m x 2.21m\nOffice space which was formally a large Bathroom and is still plumbed to allow reinstatement.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.75m x 3.75m\nLarge window space with Sea view, coving, recessed lighting, Oak flooring, door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 3m x 1.92m\nFully tiled, w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.71m x 2.48m\nLarge window with Sea and Countryside views. Oak floors, coving, recessed lighting, door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.99m x 1.44m\nFully tiled, w.c w.h.b. and shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.44m x 3.86m\nOak flooring, coving, recessed lighting, window looking onto gardens, door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.99m x 1.86m\nFully tiled, w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.39m x 3.6m\nOak flooring, coving, recessed lighting, door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.99m x 1.44m\nFully tiled with w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\n\nOutside - \nDetached Garage with roller door, separate craft room or addtional office space. May be suitable as additional living space (subject to consent).\n\n"
